    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS are delighted to present this charming three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence to the rental market. Ideally positioned on Ferguson Road in the highly sought-after Drumcondra area of Dublin 9, this lovely home offers generous accommodation, a private rear garden and an excellent location close to a wide range of amenities.\r\n\r\nNumber 123 Ferguson Road is a well-proportioned home that offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable rental property in a mature and highly convenient residential location. The property comprises approximately three bedrooms, a spacious living room, a kitchen, a main bathroom and benefits from an additional WC, together with a lovely private rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable living room, a kitchen with access to the rear garden, three bedrooms and a main bathroom. The property also benefits from an additional guest WC, providing excellent practicality for modern family living.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys a lovely private rear garden, offering a peaceful outdoor space ideal for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the warmer months. As an end-of-terrace property, the house also benefits from additional privacy and natural light.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with Ferguson Road situated in the heart of Drumcondra, one of Dublin's most established and popular residential areas. There is an excellent choice of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational facilities within easy reach. Griffith Park and the National Botanic Gardens are both close by, providing wonderful green spaces for walking and leisure.\r\n\r\nThe property is also exceptionally well served by public transport, with a wide selection of Dublin Bus routes providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, O'Connell Street and surrounding areas. Dublin City Centre is easily accessible, while Dublin Airport is also within convenient reach.\r\n\r\nThis attractive three-bedroom home combines comfortable accommodation, a private garden and an excellent location, making it an ideal choice for those looking to live close to the city while enjoying the benefits of a mature residential neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nThe property will be available to rent from Monday.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS.\r\n\r\nMOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS\r\nGosia Nowicka MIPAV MICEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 001747-009962"
      },
